sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuario (CLI)
    participant Menu as CLI / Menu
    participant ProtSvc as ProtectionService
    participant Gen as EventGenerator
    participant Hash as Hasher (SHA-256)
    participant Enc as Encryptor (AES-256-GCM)
    participant Store as ArtifactStore (FileStore)
    participant VerSvc as VerificationService
    participant Pres as Presenter

    Note over User, Pres: FASE 1: Generación y Protección (Pasos 1 a 7)
    User->>Menu: 1. Ingresar cantidad de eventos (n)
    Menu->>ProtSvc: Protect(n)
    ProtSvc->>Gen: 2. Generate(n)
    loop Para cada evento
        Gen->>Hash: 3. ComputePayloadHash(event) [excluyendo payload_hash]
        Hash-->>Gen: payload_hash
    end
    Gen-->>ProtSvc: []Event
    ProtSvc->>ProtSvc: 4. Consolidar estructura Log (JSON determinista)
    ProtSvc->>Hash: 5. HashHex(log_bytes)
    Hash-->>ProtSvc: plain_log_hash (guardar log.sha256)
    ProtSvc->>Store: Save("log.json", log_bytes, 0644)
    ProtSvc->>Store: Save("log.sha256", plain_log_hash, 0644)
    ProtSvc->>Enc: GenerateKey()
    Enc-->>ProtSvc: key_256bit
    ProtSvc->>Store: Save("key.bin", key_256bit, 0600)
    ProtSvc->>Enc: 6. Encrypt(key, log_bytes)
    Enc-->>ProtSvc: ciphertext (nonce || ciphertext || tag)
    ProtSvc->>Hash: 7. HashHex(ciphertext)
    Hash-->>ProtSvc: encrypted_log_hash
    ProtSvc->>Store: Save("log.enc", ciphertext, 0644)
    ProtSvc->>Store: Save("log.enc.sha256", encrypted_log_hash, 0644)
    ProtSvc-->>Menu: ProtectionResult
    Menu->>Pres: PresentProtection(ProtectionResult)
    Pres-->>User: Mostrar confirmación y hashes generados

    Note over User, Pres: FASE 2: Verificación y Recuperación (Pasos 8 a 10)
    User->>Menu: Seleccionar Verificación de Integridad
    Menu->>VerSvc: Verify()
    VerSvc->>Store: Load("log.enc"), Load("key.bin"), Load("log.sha256")
    Store-->>VerSvc: ciphertext, key, original_plain_hash
    VerSvc->>Enc: 8. Decrypt(key, ciphertext)
    Enc-->>VerSvc: decrypted_bytes
    VerSvc->>Store: Save("log.dec.json", decrypted_bytes, 0644)
    VerSvc->>Hash: 9. HashHex(decrypted_bytes)
    Hash-->>VerSvc: decrypted_plain_hash
    VerSvc->>VerSvc: Comparar (original_plain_hash == decrypted_plain_hash)
    VerSvc-->>Menu: 10. domain.Report (Veredicto de Integridad)
    Menu->>Pres: PresentReport(Report)
    Pres-->>User: Mostrar reporte completo con veredicto

